SELECT 425 f,profile,CASE WHEN p IS NULL THEN 'null' WHEN p>=19936 THEN 'after' WHEN p>=19905 THEN 'in' WHEN p=19904 THEN 'b001' WHEN p>19875 THEN 'b002' ELSE 'b030' END pb,CASE WHEN pd IS NULL THEN 'nopub' WHEN rq IS NULL THEN 'noreq' WHEN pd=rq THEN 'eq' WHEN pd<rq-29 THEN 'pub<req-29' WHEN pd<rq THEN 'pub<req' ELSE 'pub>req' END rel,count(*) n FROM (SELECT n.profile profile,(n.published_at+ifnull(n.published_offset,0)*60)/86400 p,(SELECT min((d.utc_seconds+d.offset_minutes*60)/86400) FROM notice_dates d WHERE d.notice_id=n.id AND d.field_id IN ('OPP-012-notice','DE1-Publication-PublicationDate')) pd,(SELECT min((d.utc_seconds+d.offset_minutes*60)/86400) FROM notice_dates d WHERE d.notice_id=n.id AND d.field_id IN ('BT-738-notice','DE1-RequestedPublicationDate')) rq FROM notices n WHERE n.fetch_id=425 AND +n.profile<>'eforms:eforms-sdk-0.1') GROUP BY profile,pb,rel
UNION ALL
SELECT 413 f,profile,CASE WHEN p IS NULL THEN 'null' WHEN p>=20301 THEN 'after' WHEN p>=20270 THEN 'in' WHEN p=20269 THEN 'b001' WHEN p>20240 THEN 'b002' ELSE 'b030' END pb,CASE WHEN pd IS NULL THEN 'nopub' WHEN rq IS NULL THEN 'noreq' WHEN pd=rq THEN 'eq' WHEN pd<rq-29 THEN 'pub<req-29' WHEN pd<rq THEN 'pub<req' ELSE 'pub>req' END rel,count(*) n FROM (SELECT n.profile profile,(n.published_at+ifnull(n.published_offset,0)*60)/86400 p,(SELECT min((d.utc_seconds+d.offset_minutes*60)/86400) FROM notice_dates d WHERE d.notice_id=n.id AND d.field_id IN ('OPP-012-notice','DE1-Publication-PublicationDate')) pd,(SELECT min((d.utc_seconds+d.offset_minutes*60)/86400) FROM notice_dates d WHERE d.notice_id=n.id AND d.field_id IN ('BT-738-notice','DE1-RequestedPublicationDate')) rq FROM notices n WHERE n.fetch_id=413 AND +n.profile<>'eforms:eforms-sdk-0.1') GROUP BY profile,pb,rel
